json5/list
description: Comma-separated list of values, enclosed into square brackets; a trailing comma is allowed
- >
  A JSON5 list is a
  [json/list](::language:01-Concretes_2:04-json_code:00-json_structured:01-json_list) with one
  sugar — a trailing comma after the last element is allowed:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  [1, 'two', [3],]
- >
  An element can be ANY JSON5 value — the grammar recurses here:
- *..:..
